1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,765
The ransom money was inside a cold
stove. The note said light it. Jason

2
00:00:05,765 --> 00:00:07,000
reached for matches.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:12,688
Lucia stopped him. A sealed cash tin
blocked the flue, turning the cabin

4
00:00:12,688 --> 00:00:14,000
