5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:19,158
The note promised a key would drop when
the stove warmed. Jason asked why

6
00:00:19,158 --> 00:00:21,000
anyone would ransom their money.

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:26,526
Because they owe us more than this,
Lucia said, and they need a reason we

8
00:00:26,526 --> 00:00:28,000
never come asking again.

9
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:34,000
She checked the chimney outside. A fresh
cap covered soot, fastened from

10
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:35,000
the roof.

11
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,550
Jason held the ladder. Lucia lifted the
cap and pulled the tin upward,

12
00:00:39,550 --> 00:00:42,000
